TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium in pure water, fixed pO2
SOLUTION 1 Pure water initial
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)  -0.7  10
    Pyrite  0    0.1
    Goethite 0   0
    Gypsum   0   0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_ox.sel
    -reset false
    -pH true
END
